        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-5\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 600,\n  \"system\": \"You are a Customer Success specialist at a SaaS company writing a re-engagement email to an at-risk account. Be warm, brief, and specific. Reference the real support signals. Offer a concrete next step (a 15-minute call). Three short paragraphs, no buzzwords. Use plain language with periods and commas. Do not use em-dashes (—) anywhere. If you would normally use an em-dash, split into two sentences or use a comma instead. Sign off with just 'Matthew Ruryk' on a single line, nothing else after your name. Return ONLY the email body text, no subject line, no preamble, no explanation.\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Draft a re-engagement email for the {{ $json.product_line }} account. Plan: {{ $json.plan_tier__SYNTH }}. They have {{ $json.open_tickets }} open support tickets and their average customer satisfaction is {{ $json.avg_satisfaction }}. Renewal is in {{ $json.days_to_renewal__SYNTH }} days. The risk reason flagged was: {{ $json.risk_reason }}.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
